# ---- hidden chords are never saved: P1 (Pop, C G Am F) LENGTH 1 on the Progression pages; the autosave (stopped,
# quiet) stores 1 bar, the hidden ones still come back (LENGTH 4) while here; hidden again, saved, a power cycle: 1 bar
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
expect app_loop 1
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
expect page 5
spin K1 -3
expect loop_bars1 1
expect loop_ch1_4 -1
expect msgtext_is_3_CHORDS_HIDDEN_BACK_IF_IT_GROWS 1
wait 4500
expect dirty 0
spin K1 3
expect loop_bars1 4
expect loop_ch1_4 700
spin K1 -3
wait 4500
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect loop_bars1 1
expect loop_ch1_4 -1
expect loop_ch1_0 0
